PERSONALLY MAKING A NUCLEAR

00:06:19.045 --> 00:06:22.849 line:0%
THREAT AND REFERRING DIRECTLY

00:06:20.913 --> 00:06:23.983 line:0%
TO ICBMS, WHICH WOULD BE

00:06:23.015 --> 00:06:24.684 line:0%
TALKING ABOUT THE U.S. AND

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:25.785 line:0%
RUSSIA.

00:06:24.851 --> 00:06:28.020 line:0%
HE'S MAKING THAT VERY CLEAR.

00:06:26.619 --> 00:06:30.890 line:0%
YOU KNOW HIM, YOU MET HIM WHEN

00:06:28.521 --> 00:06:31.591 line:0%
HE WORKED IN THE CLINICIAN,

00:06:31.057 --> 00:06:32.091 line:0%
WHEN HE WORKED IN THE BOMB

00:06:31.758 --> 00:06:33.793 line:0%
MINISTRATION.

