00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:35.862 line:0%
THREAT BUT THE THREAT OF

00:06:34.827 --> 00:06:36.329 line:0%
NUCLEAR WAR OVERALL IS

00:06:36.028 --> 00:06:37.630 line:0%
INCREASING.

