00:06:37.797 --> 00:06:40.833 line:0%
IF HE WERE TO USE NUCLEAR

00:06:39.966 --> 00:06:42.001 line:0%
WEAPONS IN ANY WAY IN UKRAINE,

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:44.604 line:0%
AND HE IS ALSO MAKING IT CLEAR

00:06:42.168 --> 00:06:47.607 line:0%
