WOULD YOU WANT THE U.S. TO

00:06:47.774 --> 00:06:50.943 line:0%
RESPOND?

00:06:49.475 --> 00:06:53.646 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I THINK THE PRESIDENT HAS

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:55.681 line:0%
