CATASTROPHIC CONSEQUENCES TO

00:07:01.854 --> 00:07:05.825 line:0%
THE USE OF THAT KIND OF WEAPON,

00:07:04.791 --> 00:07:07.794 line:0%
AND I THINK THAT'S EXACTLY WHAT

00:07:05.992 --> 00:07:11.731 line:0%
SHOULD HAPPEN.

00:07:09.495 --> 00:07:13.766 line:0%
IF PUTIN CROSSES THAT LINE AND

00:07:11.898 --> 00:07:17.937 line:0%
MAKES USE OF A NUCLEAR WEAPON

00:07:13.933 --> 00:07:20.807 line:0%
WITH REGARDS AND ALL OF THE

00:07:18.504 --> 00:07:22.809 line:0%
RAMIFICATIONS OF WHAT A NUCLEAR

00:07:20.973 --> 00:07:24.610 line:0%
WEAPON CAN DO, I THINK THE

00:07:22.975 --> 00:07:26.946 line:0%
UNITED STATES AND OUR ALLIES

00:07:24.777 --> 00:07:29.682 line:0%
HAVE TO BE WILLING TO RESPOND

00:07:27.113 --> 00:07:32.752 line:0%
WITH FORCE, IF NECESSARY, IN

00:07:29.849 --> 00:07:34.654 line:0%
ORDER TO MAKE CLEAR THAT THAT

00:07:32.919 --> 00:07:37.623 line:0%
WOULD FORCE THE UNITED STATES,

00:07:34.821 --> 00:07:40.660 line:0%
UKRAINE AND OUR ALLIES TO

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:41.227 line:0%
CONFRONT PUTIN AND THE RUSSIAN

00:07:40.827 --> 00:07:43.830 line:0%
INVASION DIRECTLY.

00:07:42.495 --> 00:07:44.931 line:0%
&gt;&gt; RUSSIA HAS NOW BLAMED

00:07:43.996 --> 00:07:46.699 line:0%
UKRAINE FOR SEVERAL ATTACKS

00:07:45.097 --> 00:07:47.934 line:0%
WITHIN RUSSIAN BORDERS.

