THE WHITE HOUSE SAID TODAY THAT

00:07:48.401 --> 00:07:50.803 line:0%
THE U.S. RESPECTS UKRAINE'S

00:07:49.168 --> 00:07:52.705 line:0%
MILITARY DECISIONS, BUT THE

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:53.906 line:0%
U.S. IS NOT ENCOURAGE OR UNABLE

00:07:52.872 --> 00:07:56.809 line:0%
TO STRIKES ON RUSSIA.

