00:08:01.514 --> 00:08:06.652 line:0%
THAT IS THE SPECULATION.

00:08:02.849 --> 00:08:10.890 line:0%
WHAT DO YOU THINK HAPPENED?

00:08:09.455 --> 00:08:12.725 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I THINK THE UKRAINIANS ARE

00:08:11.057 --> 00:08:14.994 line:0%
DEFENDING THEMSELVES, THAT'S

00:08:12.892 --> 00:08:17.897 line:0%
WHAT I THINK IS HAPPENED HERE.

