SO, I THINK THE UKRAINIANS HAVE

00:08:41.821 --> 00:08:44.657 line:0%
EVERY RIGHT TO DEFEND

00:08:43.823 --> 00:08:46.759 line:0%
THEMSELVES IN THIS SITUATION.

