00:08:58.037 --> 00:09:04.610 line:0%
HAVE A RESPONSIBILITY TO

00:08:59.839 --> 00:09:07.580 line:0%
RESPOND, SO I UNDERSTAND THERE

00:09:04.777 --> 00:09:08.047 line:0%
NEED TO BE ABLE TO DEFEND

00:09:07.747 --> 00:09:08.681 line:0%
THEMSELVES.

00:09:08.214 --> 00:09:09.682 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I WOULD THINK IT'S

00:09:08.848 --> 00:09:10.349 line:0%
SIGNIFICANT, RIGHT YOU'RE NOT

